# Agent workflow (mandatory)

## Do not run or verify UI in a browser

- Do **not** run `npm run dev`, `vite`, `npm run preview`, or open `localhost` URLs.
- Do **not** open the deployed GitHub Pages site to verify UI changes.
- Do **not** use browser automation, screen recordings, or screenshots to validate UI work — it is slow and not requested unless the user explicitly asks.
- **`npm run build`** (compile check) is sufficient for finishing UI tasks unless the user asks for manual testing.

## Always merge completed work to `main`

- Do **not** leave finished work on an open PR branch without merging.
- When a task is complete and `npm run build` passes, **merge to `main`**.
- Do not treat "PR created" as done — merge is required unless the user explicitly asks to hold the PR open.
- Pushes to `main` deploy automatically via `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` → `gh-pages` → https://thisguyse19.github.io/iwant/
